#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Odoo empowers you to manage every aspect of your construction projects "
"effortlessly and efficiently, and its integrated applications ensure "
"unparalleled success and client satisfaction."
msgstr ""
"Odoo memberdayakan Anda untuk menangani setiap aspek konstruksi project Anda "
"secara mudah dan efisien, dan aplikasi terintegrasi Odoo memastikan "
"kesuksesan yang tiada tanding serta klien yang puas."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Odoo offers scalable solutions that grow with your business. By integrating "
"these apps,\n"
"            construction companies can maximize efficiency, improve client "
"relations, and reduce\n"
"            operational risks."
msgstr ""
"Odoo menawarkan solusi yang mengikuti pertumbuhan bisnis Anda. Dengan "
"mengintegrasikan aplikasi-aplikasi ini,\n"
"            perusahaan konstruksi dapat memaksimalkan efisiensi, "
"meningkatkan hubungan dengan klien, dan mengurangi\n"
"            risiko operasional."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Odoo scans every component within your Work Items to find underlying needs, "
"filtering components by the Material Cost Nature, ensuring your list isn't "
"cluttered with labor or equipment hours."
msgstr ""
"Odoo memindai setiap komponen dalam Item Pekerjaan untuk menemukan kebutuhan "
"yang mendasarinya, menyaring komponen berdasarkan Jenis Biaya Material, "
"memastikan daftar Anda tidak dipenuhi jam kerja atau jam penggunaan "
"peralatan."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Of course, these default tasks can be adapted in the\n"
"                    Project Template according to your personal way of "
"managing a construction\n"
"                    project."
msgstr ""
"Tentu saja, tugas-tugas default ini dapat disesuaikan dalam\n"
"                    Template Project sesuai dengan cara Anda mengelola "
"project\n"
"                    konstruksi."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Of course, this is just an overview of the features included in this "
"package. Feel free\n"
"            to add new apps, delete/modify demo data, and test everything "
"around!"
msgstr ""
"Tentu saja, ini hanyalah gambaran umum fitur-fitur yang termasuk di paket "
"ini. Jangan ragu\n"
"             untuk menambahkan aplikasi baru, menghapus/memodifikasi data "
"demo, dan menguji semua yang Anda lihat!"

